https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-10-04T15:20:59Z","label":{"name":"bug","color":"EB484F"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/969285721","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/issues/16232#issuecomment-969285721","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/16232","id":969285721,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAzqfmc45xiBZ","user":{"login":"jam-awake","id":87721503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzIxNTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87721503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake","html_url":"https://github.com/jam-awake","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jam-awake/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-11-15T20:19:21Z","updated_at":"2021-11-15T20:19:37Z","body":"I believe this was supposed to look up the [`element` parameter value](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/main/addons/a11y/README.md?plain=1#L175-L176), if it is provided. I just specified the `element` parameter on Storybook 6.3.12 and I get \"The scan encountered an error: {}\" in the panel. When I dropped the `element` parameter, the addon works fine. So, I explored the source code to see the control flow:\r\n\r\n1. [`axe` is run on the `element` identifier](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/main/addons/a11y/src/a11yRunner.ts#L50)\r\n1. [the `element` identifier refers to the element specified in input or the return of `getElement` if it isn't provided](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/main/addons/a11y/src/a11yRunner.ts#L44)\r\n1. [`getElement`](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/main/addons/a11y/src/a11yRunner.ts#L19-L22) refers to an HTML element, either `#root`, the top-level div that contains a story by default when no decorators are used, or `#story-root`, a mysterious value.\r\n1. [`input` is the value returned by `getParams`](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/main/addons/a11y/src/a11yRunner.ts#L38)\r\n1. [`getParams`](https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/main/addons/a11y/src/a11yRunner.ts#L69-L80) either returns the `element` parameter if specified or null.\r\n\r\nSo, your real problem is that the `element` parameter's docs are incorrect. That parameter currently seems to do nothing.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/969285721/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jam-awake","id":87721503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3